<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-MINALI WINS 16TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MINALI WINS 16TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>SABINANIGO, Spain</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nicola Minali of Italy won the 16th stage of the Tour of Spain over 222 kms from Logrono to Sabinanigo on Monday.</p>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
